    "reviews": "\u201cThe story does grab you, especially with the relationship between Wraith and Tide. There's also some weird stuff going on in this military base where you really don't know who to trust. The more things unravel the more questions you have. The story is really addictive, and the animated CGs really add to it. I'm very excited to see where this game goes because I AM HOOKED!\u201d<br>PajamaKen<br>",
